 "name_en": "Automation of Source-to-Pay with SAP Business Network (42K)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Automation of Source-to-Pay with SAP Business Network (42K)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Automation of purchase order to payment processing in the SAP Business Network for Procurement with SAP Ariba Commerce Automation integration enables you to connect seamlessly from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to your suppliers in the SAP Business Network for Procurement. You can send electronic purchase orders to your suppliers using the SAP Business Network for Procurement and receive electronic order confirmations, advance shipping notices, and invoices from your suppliers in the SAP Business Network for Procurementk in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>. You can use SAP Business Network for Procurement integration in the procurement of direct or indirect materials and in the procurement of project-based services processes. You can also send payment advice in electronic form to your suppliers via the SAP Business Network for Procurement.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Digitized collaboration with your suppliers in the SAP Business Network for Procurement supports you in speeding up procurement to payment processes and in reducing the number of manual process steps, reducing the cost of transactions with your suppliers.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Send approved purchase orders electronically to your suppliers via the SAP Business Network for Procurement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive digital order confirmations automatically from your suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process digital advanced shipping notification sent by your suppliers electronically in the SAP Business Network for Procurement into inbound deliveries in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send goods receipt automatically to suppliers in the SAP Business Network for Procurement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive invoices from suppliers electronically in the SAP Business Network for Procurement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update suppliers digitally in the SAP Business Network for Procurement on invoice status updates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Start payment runs upon receiving supplier invoices in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> Accounts Payable</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send payment advice automatically to suppliers via the SAP Business Network for Procurement</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce transaction costs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Speed up procurement processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual process steps and achieve 98% touchless invoice processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase productivity of procurement and accounts payable staff</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce inquiries about payments from suppliers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase productivity in accounts payables department</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Business Network 的寻源到付款自动化 (42K)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Business Network for Procurement 与 SAP Ariba Commerce Automation 集成中的订购单到付款处理自动化使您能够从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 无缝连接到 SAP Business Network for Procurement 中的供应商。您可以使用 SAP Business Network for Procurement 向供应商发送电子采购订单，并在 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 的 SAP Business Network for Procurementk 中接收供应商的电子订单确认、提前发货通知和发票。您可以在直接或间接物料的采购以及基于项目的服务流程的采购中使用 SAP Business Network for Procurement 集成。您还可以通过 SAP Business Network for Procurement 以电子形式向供应商发送付款通知。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">与 SAP Business Network for Procurement 中的供应商进行数字化协作支持您加速采购到付款流程，并减少手动流程步骤，从而降低与供应商进行交易的成本。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Business Network for Procurement 以电子方式将批准的采购订单发送给您的供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动接收来自供应商的数字订单确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Business Network for Procurement 中以电子方式将供应商的数字提前装运通知处理为 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的入库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Business Network for Procurement 中自动将收货发送给供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Business Network for Procurement 中以电子方式接收来自供应商的发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据发票状态更新在 SAP Business Network for Procurement 中以数字方式更新供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 应付账款中收到供应商发票后开始付款运行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Business Network for Procurement 自动向供应商发送付款通知</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2d426f343c20413b900e7ccd64b8517e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">降低交易成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加快采购流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少手动流程步骤，实现 98% 的自动化发票处理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高采购和应付账款人员的工作效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少关于供应商付款的询问</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高应付账款部门的工作效率</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
